 448:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
 449:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Read an incoming command from the down channel and process it.
 450:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 451:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
