 617:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
 618:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pStartPacket - Pointer to start of packet payload.
 619:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *                   There must be at least 4 bytes free to prepend Id and Length.
 620:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pEndPacket   - Pointer to end of packet payload.
 621:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    EventId      - Id of the event to send.
 622:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 623:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
