1216:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1217:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
1218:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    This function initializes the RTT channel used to transport 
1219:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    SEGGER SystemView packets. 
1220:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The channel is assigned the label "SysView" for client software 
