1223:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Notes
1224:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The channel is configured by the macro SEGGER_SYSVIEW_RTT_CHANNEL.
1225:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
